{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis is the demo version of \u300aDark Lord Leona\u300b. The full release will feature even more exciting content\uff01</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/f2037116589e3b2ba9c916ac580cffa3.avif?t=1755941354\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >666 years after the extermination of the demon race, the Demon King's daughter, Leona, awakens and resolves to execute the &quot;Demon Instrumentality&quot;. This plan involves seeking powerful genes across various nations, engaging in reproduction, and giving birth to potent hybrid offspring to dominate these nations, ultimately spreading demon influence across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/b06185976161c609396219359c3f928c.poster.avif?t=1755941354\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/b06185976161c609396219359c3f928c.webm?t=1755941354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/b06185976161c609396219359c3f928c.mp4?t=1755941354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/20ca6e199f34ea3666b29b586162c019.avif?t=1755941354\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dark Lord Leona</i> is a fast-paced card strategy game where you strategize and combine your playstyle each turn to crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/8a5543a173d4e31fdb6d41979ff7cfd6.poster.avif?t=1755941354\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/8a5543a173d4e31fdb6d41979ff7cfd6.webm?t=1755941354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/925faed33c9a4ff9c73010284171c449.avif?t=1755941354\" width=600 height=70 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leona</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confidence and wildness define her. As the daughter of the Demon King, she aims to conquer the world while searching for suitable races to seed across the lands, fulfilling the &quot;Demon Instrumentality&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/cf83b06f55814daca26ed2bd2e4d6541.avif?t=1755941354\" width=250 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alec</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leona's loyal confidant, dedicated to assisting her in realizing the Demonic Completion Plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/c7e359d6a46b7d26e4e4311feae2db3e.avif?t=1755941354\" width=250 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950040/extras/3aa